Package: aisdk.mcp
Title: Model Context Protocol (MCP) Client and Server for 'aisdk'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yonghe", "Xia", , "xiayh17@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Model Context Protocol ('MCP') support for the 'aisdk' toolkit:
    a client for connecting to and using tools from local (stdio) or remote
    ('SSE') MCP servers, a server for exposing R functions as MCP tools, and
    discovery helpers. Lets 'aisdk' agents interoperate with the wider MCP
    ecosystem.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports: aisdk (>= 1.4.12), httr2, R6, jsonlite, rlang, processx, callr, utils
Suggests: withr, curl, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/YuLab-SMU/aisdk.mcp
BugReports: https://github.com/YuLab-SMU/aisdk.mcp/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
